/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We are excited to announce the latest release of Dhatuki, the annual newsletter of the Department of Metallurgical Engineering and Materials. This edition is a testament to the hard work of our team. As we reflect on centuries of technological progress, it is evident that the development of materials science has been a driving force. Looking ahead, material innovation will continue to shape future inventions. However, this fact is not always apparent, especially to those new to the field. This is why I believe the Dhatuki team is doing an exceptional job of highlighting the importance of materials through their thought-provoking writings. We would like to extend a big shoutout to the team for their outstanding work.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
