/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Since time immemorial, advancements in materials science have been the driving force for human progress. Materials science stands as a pillar of scientific innovation, enabling advancements across various industries. Among the myriad of fields that benefit from materials science, semiconductor technologies stand at the forefront of technological innovation, driving advancements that touch every aspect of our modern lives. Semiconductors, the foundation of modern electronics, have revolutionized the world by powering our smartphones, computers, and countless other devices.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
