/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Can you give a brief overview of the research done in your lab?)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Over the last 30 years I have focused on the low thermal budget synthesis of Silicon based thin films for application in photo-voltaics, detectors, light emitting diodes and other semiconductor thin film devices. Our main contribution is the establishing of the Hot Wire Chemical Vapor Deposition \(HWCVD\) for this synthesis. In the last 10 years we have ventured into the synthesis and application of the Silicon Nanowires \(again synthesized by the HWCVD\) with great success in the energy storage landscape.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (What was your motivation to pursue research and what do you look for in students that want to pursue research?)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In my early college days itself I was fascinated by various technological developments and had almost decided to pursue research, though the exact area was not clear. During those days the conversion of sunlight into electricity ie solar cells was being promoted since people realized that the fossil fuels were not a permanent source of energy and this photovoltaic conversion is also ecologically highly beneficial.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( I was also lucky to get an opportunity to join the group of the eminent scientist Prof. V. G. Bhide to do research in this area. Our group was one of the three groups in the country to initiate research in developing Amorphous Silicon thin film solar cells. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Pursuing research must be internally driven and deeply rooted in the mind of the student. Research is nothing but journey undertaken to unravel the mysteries of the nature and make them useful for the utilization for mankind. Applied research leading to technology development is a natural outcome of understanding fundamental concepts. So a researcher should have passion to explore such natural phenomena and convert them to applications. This calls for a huge commitment and endurance but there is lot of satisfaction and joy in the end. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
