/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Balancing stability, efficiency, and production cost is crucial for entry into the solar cells industry. Perovskite solar cells offer lower production costs due to simpler fabrication, but they have high moisture and photo instability which is a challenge that the researchers are actively addressing today. The steps for introducing OMHP solar cells into the industry have already begun. This month, the first report on the industrial roll-to-roll printing method for the production of hybrid perovskite solar cell modules marks the headway of this innovation from research labs into the industrial space and hopefully into the market soon. Another promising field in which halide perovskites are making great strides is LED technology. )
/E (Balancing stability, efficiency, and production cost is crucial for entry into the solar cells industry. Perovskite solar cells offer lower production costs due to simpler fabrication, but they have high moisture and photo instability which is a challenge that the researchers are actively addressing today. The steps for introducing OMHP solar cells into the industry have already begun. This month, the first report on the industrial roll-to-roll printing method for the production of hybrid perovskite solar cell modules marks the headway of this innovation from research labs into the industrial space and hopefully into the market soon. Another promising field in which halide perovskites are making great strides is LED technology. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
