>>
endobj
354 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I have also completed two other courses for my electrical minor, EE221 \(Digital Electronics, 5th Sem\) and EE229 \(Signal Processing, 6th Sem\), which are indirectly related to my interests. In my 6th Semester, I took up two more chemistry courses: CH504 \(Computational Chemistry\) and CH438 \(Main Group Chemistry\), to learn about other aspects of materials chemistry.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
