/S /H1
/T (Moreover, the interaction with seasoned professionals provided invaluable insights into the practical challenges and innovative solutions driving the industry forward. Engaging discussions ranged from metallurgical nuances to the future trajectory of materials science, igniting sparks of inspiration amongst the students.)
