401 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Metals and Materials Summit was a two day event organised on 24th-25th September 2022. The summit consisted of workshops, seminars panel discussions and competitions. The first day of the summit has workshop on Laser Applications and a Treasure Hunt over the academic area, apart from the event inauguration. The speaker of the workshop was Prof. Shobha Shukla who gave the participants a brief overview of Laser and its Applications.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
