/S /P
/E <>
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
405 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The second half of the day was started with a Poster Presentation competition, in which PhD students presented their research with the help of posters. This was followed with a panel discussion on Sustainability of Materials, paneled by Rishi Pathania \(Head Sustainability - UPL\), Nirbhay Lumde \(Head CSR APAC - CGI\), and Prof. Pradip Kalbar\(CUSE, IIT Bombay\). The discussion was done on Sustainability of metals and their roles in achieving net zero & circular economy, policies adopted by companies and government to enhance material performance and make it more sustainable and recent developments in sustainable chemicals and materials. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
