417 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (It brings me great joy to present to you the latest edition of our department newsletter, Dhatuki. Our department has a rich history, dating back to the very establishment of our esteemed institution in 1958. Over the years, we have continually strived for excellence in all aspects, be it academics, research, administration, or laboratory work.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
418 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As the General Secretary of the department, I am immensely proud of the strides we have made in fostering a culture of excellence. It is with this spirit that I extend a warm message to each and every student within our department:)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
419 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ("As students of this department, we're privileged to belong to a longstanding fraternity that offers access to a wealth of resources, including the guidance of esteemed professors, cutting-edge laboratories, experienced seniors, and top-notch facilities. It is incumbent upon us to capitalize on these resources and actively engage in learning from them. The department's commitment to enhancing the student learning experience is evident through recent curriculum changes. I encourage you to explore beyond the confines of textbooks and immerse yourselves in the realms of research and entrepreneurship. In this edition of Dhatuki, we aim to provide you with a diverse array of insights, including interviews with our professors on their latest research endeavors and updates on the latest advancements in the field of Material Sciences.")
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
420 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I extend my heartfelt gratitude to all the professors, seniors, and alumni who have graciously shared their expertise and insights with us. Special thanks are also due to our esteemed HoD, Prof. N. Vishwanathan, for his invaluable guidance and unwavering support, without which this publication would not have been possible.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
421 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Furthermore, I commend the tireless efforts of the team, led by Bhumika Bhangale. Their dedication and hard work have culminated in the successful publication of this edition, aimed at benefitting both current and future students of the department.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
422 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I trust that you will find this edition of Dhatuki both insightful and enriching. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [6]
>>
